+{
+  "about": "The key page (/login/key/): its words and its Content-Security-Policy. Read by newsroom/build/features/login.mjs (cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis, 27 November 2026, for cl-6.security's S17).",
+  "title": "Make or unlock your key",
+  "summary": "Editors and reviewers make their own key in this browser, keep a backup sealed with their own passphrase, and send only the public half to be enrolled. The key is held in this page's memory and nowhere else unless you ask.",
+  "md": [
+    "Your key is made **here, in your browser**. No agent makes it or holds it. The private halves leave this page only in a backup file, sealed with your own passphrase (PBKDF2, 600 000 rounds, AES-256-GCM); the page keeps them as keys it can use but never read out, and only in memory, so closing or reloading the page forgets them.",
+    "",
+    "1. **Make your key** with a passphrase of at least 12 characters. Download the backup file and keep it safe: it is the only way back.",
+    "2. **Send the public key** the page shows to Dinis. He decides who is enrolled, and an enrolment is a public signed statement.",
+    "3. **Next visit, unlock** the key from the backup file and the passphrase.",
+    "",
+    "Signing happens only when you press a button, over the exact text the page shows you. Nothing is sent from this page to any server. Readers need no key: every page of the site is public.",
+    "",
+    "::: pt-key pt-login",
+    "This page needs JavaScript: the key is made and used in this browser.",
+    ":::"
+  ],
+  "csp": "default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'",
+  "head": [
+    "<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\">",
+    "<meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\">"
+  ]
+}
